  Couldn't set up your sandbox with Administrator permissions

  You can still use Corbanu Terminal in a non-admin sandbox. It carries greater risk if prompt injected.
  The non-admin sandbox blocks writes and deletes outside your workspace except in low-integrity folders, but it can't
  stop commands from reading your files and its network block can be bypassed.
  Learn more <https://developers.openai.com/codex/windows>

› 1. Try setting up admin sandbox again
  2. Use Codex with non-admin sandbox    Doesn't block reading your files; its network block can be bypassed
  3. Quit

  Press enter to confirm or esc to go back
